\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 1. The Pre-existing Safety Profile\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Because the project had successfully completed 
\f0\b Phase I (healthy volunteer safety trials)
\f1\b0  and early preclinical animal testing, the acute toxicology data was already locked.\
\ls1\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Janine was not injecting Sarah with a blind chemical guess; she possessed the established safety limits and baseline cellular kinetics of the platform. She knew the baseline dose would not cause immediate, acute lethality in a normal human host.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 \strokec2 2. The Nature of Phase IIa Risk\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls2\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Phase IIa is explicitly designed to test a drug in a small, select group of patients who actively display the target pathology (in this case, genetic wasting conditions like Muscular Dystrophy).\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The primary risk was 
\f0\b unpredictable integration kinetics inside diseased, unstable tissue
\f1\b0 . The official safety profiles were entirely mapped out on healthy, non-dividing cell lines.\
\ls2\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Janine knew that Sarah's hyper-dividing, structurally fractured muscle cells were completely untested territory, and that her gamble involved pushing the viral volume past the modeled threshold to force an integration event before the tissue could suffer localized necrosis.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 \strokec2 3. Access to High-Concentration Batches\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls3\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Because the laboratory was actively setting up these specific Phase IIa dose-ranging protocols, it possessed the exact 
\f0\b high-concentration operational batches
\f1\b0  intended for localized tissue trials.\
\ls3\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 This specific phase provided the physical window for Janine's theft: she was able to siphon off these concentrated trial vials in parallel, monitoring the official data trends at work to adjust her covert, high-dose treatments on Sarah at home.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\fs28 \cf0 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs40 \cf0 \strokec2 4. The Boardroom Pitch Milestone\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\sa240\partightenfactor0
\ls4\ilvl0
\f1\b0\fs32 \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Phase IIa represents the exact maturity milestone required for an internal corporate or state-sponsored announcement.\
\ls4\ilvl0\kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The project had achieved its "proof of concept" by demonstrating that a single dose provided a massive, universal panacea effect that neutralized TMinus and extended life before eventually decaying. This made it the perfect time for Hermann to present the findings to secure massive funding for a future Phase III production rollout, while still keeping the drug completely unreleased and months or years away from public availability.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

